#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0586 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "THE FIXTURE THAT PINS THE SHEET DEFECT'S RESOLUTION. AVAL is ZERO, so the percent change is undefined and the Description says such records are not evaluated. Since D85 (typed-expression-engine phase 3) the ENGINE no longer delivers that carve-out - a zero divisor is MissingValue.MIS and the not-equal fires - so the guard is now AUTHORED in the Check (AVAL != 0), which this fixture pins. 999 is deliberately absurd. The workbook's own guard names the WRONG operand (AD0586-F1, sheet issue owed); guarding the real divisor is the coherent reading."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col BASE    type=Num
col AVAL    type=Num
col PBCHG   type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | GLUC | 120 | 0 | 999
